#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:5
#: 60fef21e969f4bbc99a7e0f0689ea8e2
msgid "Currawong Velocity CAN ESCs"
msgstr "Currawong Velocity CAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:9
#: 310157ee0edd472d947cc62f28c13511
msgid ""
"Currawong's `Velocity range of ESCs <https://www.currawongeng.com/servos-"
"escs/velocity/>`__ provide motor control for the aerospace sector, with a"
" high degree of reliability."
msgstr ""
"Currawong 的 `Velocity 系列 ESC <https://www.currawongeng.com/servos-"
"escs/velocity/>`__ 为航空航天领域提供高可靠性的电机控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:11
#: 8108aa91ef304e7a9ff4e3c321c4625a
msgid ""
"Designed for driving extremely large motors for heavy-lift applications, "
"the Velocity range of ESCs is available in power levels above 20kW"
msgstr "专为驱动重载应用中的超大型电机而设计，Velocity 系列 ESC 的功率等级超过 20kW"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:13
#: 1c730f404aa547a8843e4516e7a71dc3
msgid "Up to 18S (75V) battery packs"
msgstr "支持最高 18S（75V）电池组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:14
#: a2d0e807c0b64875a54f52295f5b442a
msgid "Sustained currents above 300A"
msgstr "持续电流超过 300A"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:15
#: 3a46260ea57247b48366375d6903c87c
msgid "Compact design"
msgstr "紧凑设计"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:16
#: fce0ee427a79430190c813327fec8e4c
msgid "Fully isolated communication interface"
msgstr "完全隔离的通信接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:17
#: 1380af755c084bc09bf824afd10f61bb
msgid "Designed and manufactured in Australia"
msgstr "澳大利亚设计制造"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:19
#: eb69f93ed84c438c9a1662466e460fdd
msgid ""
"The Velocity ESC provides a CAN communication interface for commands and "
"telemetry. A traditional digital PWM interface is also supported. They "
"support both PiccoloCAN and DroneCAN protocols."
msgstr ""
"Velocity ESC 提供用于命令和遥测的 CAN 通信接口，同时也支持传统数字 PWM 接口。支持 PiccoloCAN 和 "
"DroneCAN 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:21
#: 3bc3aa85f27846d78a887a49d54e4f09
msgid ""
"Additionally, the Velocity ESC provides an optional hardware interlock "
"for increased operator safety."
msgstr "此外，Velocity ESC 提供可选的硬件联锁，以增强操作员安全性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:24
#: cedd0bc0eac5475da8661fd846ba1806
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:26
#: dc4c54529ede49a1ade104d976560506
msgid ""
"Contact `Currawong Engineering <https://www.currawongeng.com/about-us"
"/contact-us/>`__ for purchasing details."
msgstr ""
"请联系 `Currawong Engineering <https://www.currawongeng.com/about-us"
"/contact-us/>`__ 获取购买详情。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:30
#: f4db077b90a44784a850b18de5421002
msgid "PiccoloCAN Setup"
msgstr "PiccoloCAN 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:34
#: 1c9c1ded959c43c7bd3b8158ea4d3e95
msgid ""
"The Velocity ESC supports the PiccoloCAN protocol. Originally developed "
"for the Piccolo autopilot, the protocol is now natively supported by "
"ArduPilot"
msgstr "Velocity ESC 支持 PiccoloCAN 协议。该协议最初为 Piccolo 飞控开发，现已在 ArduPilot 中原生支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:37
#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:66
#: 0ae8a8d3471d47b39640400b79146660 7aaadd7edf084916ae6300f575b4f0b8
msgid "ArduPilot Configuration"
msgstr "ArduPilot 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:39
#: e920844a238b4e9497217cac1215b64d
msgid ""
"To enable communication with the Velocity ESCs using PiccoloCAN, the "
"following parameters must be set."
msgstr "要使用 PiccoloCAN 启用与 Velocity ESC 的通信，必须设置以下参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:41
#: f229c90e80574f95a6ae30ad24d644c7
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 4 (PiccoloCAN)"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL <CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` = 4（PiccoloCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:42
#: 7ead4acb9027452aa59432405ff9b19f
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (First driver) to specify "
"that the ESCs are connected to the CAN1 port"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（第一个驱动），指定 ESC 连接到 CAN1 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:44
#: ff2a323296cc46fab3fc172142f5a230
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 and :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000 so ArduPilot uses an output range that matches the "
"ESCs input range"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MIN <MOT_PWM_MIN>` = 1000 和 :ref:`MOT_PWM_MAX "
"<MOT_PWM_MAX>` = 2000，使 ArduPilot 的输出范围与 ESC 的输入范围匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:48
#: 31bf98007c504b799ceadb3dd637d68f
msgid ""
"Set ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to each motor channel (e.g. 33 - 40 for motors 1 "
"- 8). This is automatically configured when setting frame class/type. If "
"a motor channel isn't assigned to a servo output, commands won't be sent "
"to the associated ESC."
msgstr ""
"将 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设置为每个电机通道（例如电机 1-8 对应 "
"33-40）。设置机架类型时会自动配置。如果某个电机通道未分配给舵机输出，则不会向对应 ESC 发送命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:50
#: 8cbac414c8904a0b96addfc47e788632
msgid ""
"By default, all configured motor channels are used to send control "
"commands to Velocity ESCs. These control messages are transmitted by the "
"autopilot at a default rate of 50Hz. These parameters can be modified "
"using:"
msgstr "默认情况下，所有已配置的电机通道都用于向 Velocity ESC 发送控制命令。这些控制消息由飞控以默认 50Hz 频率发送。可通过以下参数修改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:52
#: bf86f68c329441acbdab7b85107935c4
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM>` parameter is a bitmask "
"that determines which ESC (motor) channels are transmitted over CAN"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_BM>` 参数是一个位掩码，决定哪些 ESC（电机）通道通过 CAN "
"发送"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:53
#: 9cccf8f5498849c8b5725058c6ec62c4
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT>` parameter determines the "
"rate (Hz) at which commands are sent out to the connected Velocity ESCs"
msgstr ""
":ref:`CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT <CAN_D1_PC_ESC_RT>` 参数决定向已连接的 Velocity ESC "
"发送命令的速率（Hz）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:70
#: 1bba3e9c5bc54060be97a2c3459b4e46 46444704266b4e829b1b5bac288b1544
msgid "ESC Configuration"
msgstr "ESC 配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:57
#: 9dc2ab10101143e7b214cd53a55c18ce
msgid ""
"The following configuration settings should be used on the Velocity ESC "
"for operation with Ardupilot:"
msgstr "在与 ArduPilot 配合使用时，应在 Velocity ESC 上使用以下配置设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:59
#: cc873e0703424223be28e883b465ca57
msgid ""
"Set Piccolo Node ID to the motor channel the ESC should listen to. Note "
"this may not be the same as the configured servo output number."
msgstr "将 Piccolo Node ID 设置为 ESC 应监听的电机通道。注意这可能与已配置的舵机输出编号不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:60
#: 5000311bb4c446ac8b1ad831af8e99d5
msgid "Enable ``Listen for Broadcast Commands``."
msgstr "启用 ``Listen for Broadcast Commands``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:63
#: 88d0fac136ae4ce9b8c79ed86be567c5
msgid "DroneCAN Setup"
msgstr "DroneCAN 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:67
#: 135bd8f47ca04597bef66a52aceec7c1
msgid "Refer to :ref:`DroneCAN ESCs Autopilot Setup<common-uavcan-escs>`."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`DroneCAN ESCs Autopilot Setup<common-uavcan-escs>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:71
#: 9ab66a251fac4f08a7d0e8250f5ef4d4
msgid ""
"To configure the ESC to receive commands from ``SERVOx`` output, set "
"``dronecan.escIndex`` to ``x - 1`` (e.g. for ``SERVO5``, set ``escIndex``"
" = 4). Note that this is different to PiccoloCAN, where motor channels "
"are assigned to node ids, rather than servo output channels to the "
"``escIndex``."
msgstr ""
"要配置 ESC 接收来自 ``SERVOx`` 输出的命令，将 ``dronecan.escIndex`` 设置为 ``x - 1``（例如，对于"
" ``SERVO5``，设置 ``escIndex`` = 4）。注意这与 PiccoloCAN 不同，后者将电机通道分配给节点 "
"ID，而非将舵机输出通道分配给 ``escIndex``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:72
#: 2b9c7c9a9dbb469386ed476bf17a913e
msgid ""
"Telemetry periods can be configured with the ``dronecan.messagePeriods`` "
"settings."
msgstr "遥测周期可通过 ``dronecan.messagePeriods`` 设置配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:73
#: c31c3cd1da354ade94b7a17fe62f7a81
msgid ""
"By default, the ESC respects arming messages from the Autopilot. To "
"always software enable the ESC when a command is received, and ignore "
"arming messages, set ``config.swInhibit`` = 1 (False)."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，ESC 遵循飞控的解锁消息。若要在收到命令时始终软件启用 ESC 并忽略解锁消息，设置 ``config.swInhibit`` = "
"1（False）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:75
#: b39180a816ce452da3034715cc6efe39
msgid ""
"By default, the Velocity ESC is configured to use Dynamic Node id "
"Allocation (DNA). ``dronecan.nodeId`` should be set to \"0\" (to use "
"DNA), unless all devices on the CAN bus are configured to use static IDs."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Velocity ESC 配置为使用动态节点 ID 分配（DNA）。除非 CAN 总线上的所有设备都配置为使用静态 ID，否则 "
"``dronecan.nodeId`` 应设置为 「0」（以使用 DNA）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:77
#: 100e9358df284571a5a84fdfaa95b5ea
msgid ""
"Only the DroneCAN specific settings are shown when fetching settings "
"using the DroneCAN protocol. The full suite of Velocity ESC settings can "
"be configured by enabling the ``show_advanced`` setting."
msgstr ""
"使用 DroneCAN 协议获取设置时，只显示 DroneCAN 特定设置。可通过启用 ``show_advanced`` 设置来配置 "
"Velocity ESC 的完整设置套件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:81
#: 962660cc6ae1444199b1bd975c18f77f
msgid ""
"It is recommended to configure your motor, and perform ESC and motor "
"validation using PiccoloCAN with CEquip, and swap to DroneCAN, if "
"required, during vehicle integration."
msgstr "建议使用 PiccoloCAN 配合 CEquip 配置电机并进行 ESC 和电机验证，并在飞行器集成期间（如需）切换到 DroneCAN。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:84
#: ea9b9147eb104282a7e77650917984d6
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:86
#: 67c87d015b9a4c569681ecadbb601f68
msgid ""
"Velocity ESCs provide comprehensive telemetry information back to the "
"autopilot which is recorded in the autopilot's onboard log, and can be "
"viewed in any :ref:`ArduPilot compatible log viewer <common-logs>`.  This"
" information includes:"
msgstr ""
"Velocity ESC 向飞控提供全面的遥测信息，记录在飞控的机载日志中，可在任意 :ref:`ArduPilot 兼容日志查看器 "
"<common-logs>` 中查看。这些信息包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:88
#: 404a190f02624ed2868b936e718a1587
msgid "RPM"
msgstr "RPM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:89
#: fc74804d2d074dbd8f07ea8d899dafcc
msgid "Voltage"
msgstr "电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:90
#: 458794419afc4d63a8ac3901cc7733c2
msgid "ESC Temperature"
msgstr "ESC 温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:91
#: 75d618a8251a4497bdf200bcc06846f1
msgid "Motor current"
msgstr "电机电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:92
#: 5f45933ee22a4e6b988307c0240e014e
msgid "Motor Temperature (when used with an external sensor)"
msgstr "电机温度（使用外置传感器时）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:94
#: dc5137e4c9914ac9bfc6c20cb38d8907
msgid ""
"This information (except the motor temperature) can also be viewed in "
"real-time using a ground station.  If using the Mission Planner go to the"
" Flight Data screen's status tab and look for (e.g.) esc1_rpm."
msgstr ""
"此信息（电机温度除外）也可通过地面站实时查看。如果使用 Mission Planner，进入飞行数据界面的 status "
"选项卡，查找（例如）esc1_rpm。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-velocity-can-escs.rst:102
#: 0e415080b92d4e89a1ebac27d3e7c459
msgid ""
"Sending ESC data to the GCS requires using MAVLink2.  Please check the "
"appropriate SERIALx_PROTOCOL parameter is 2 (where \"x\" is the serial "
"port number used for the telemetry connection)."
msgstr ""
"向 GCS 发送 ESC 数据需要使用 MAVLink2。请确认相应的 SERIALx_PROTOCOL 参数为 2（其中 「x」 "
"是用于数传连接的串口编号）。"

